stateDiagram-v2
    %% Wizard steps (src/stores/wizard.ts). Steps unlock in order: finishing a
    %% step marks it completed and opens the next one, and the sidebar can jump
    %% back to any step up to the first one that is not completed. Navigation
    %% is locked while a scan, build, recovery download or flash is running.
    [*] --> welcome

    welcome --> scan : start (or resume a saved session)
    scan --> hardware : scan finished, profile imported or demo
    hardware --> compatibility : profile confirmed
    compatibility --> bios : target macOS chosen
    bios --> build : checklist read
    build --> review : build_efi succeeded
    review --> deploy : continue
    deploy --> complete : USB written, or finished without a USB drive

    complete --> welcome : start over

    hardware --> scan : rescan / import (reopens hardware and later)
    compatibility --> hardware : profile edited (reopens compatibility and later)
    bios --> compatibility : target changed (reopens compatibility and later)
    review --> build : build options changed (reopens build and later)

    note right of scan
        Windows / Linux: scan_hardware on this machine.
        Any host: import_profile from a JSON
        exported on the target PC.
    end note

    note right of compatibility
        check_compatibility lists the macOS versions
        this hardware can run (10.13 to 26) and why
        newer ones are not offered.
    end note

    note right of build
        plan_build previews the plan before any download.
        build_efi downloads, assembles and validates.
    end note

    note right of deploy
        download_recovery, then
        flash_prepare_confirmation and flash_usb.
        Writing is disabled in demo mode.
    end note
